{"id":"84a4c3a277344dd9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ind-cpa.md","title":"Chosen-Plaintext Indistinguishability","display":"df-ind-cpa — Chosen-Plaintext Indistinguishability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-ind-cpa","aliases":["28-df-ind-cpa","IND-CPA Security"],"display":"df-ind-cpa — Chosen-Plaintext Indistinguishability","depends_on":["[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","[[28-df-symmetric-encryption]]","[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-ppt]]"],"source_book_location":"§9.5.1 many-message encryption discussion only; printed p.191; PDF p.217","source_printed_pages":"191","source_pdf_pages":"217","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ind-cpa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ind-cpa</span><span>IND-CPA Security</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ind-cpa — Chosen-Plaintext Indistinguishability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"01442afa54980587\" href=\"?note=01442afa54980587\" title=\"28-df-symmetric-encryption\">28-df-symmetric-encryption</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§9.5.1 many-message encryption discussion only; printed p.191; PDF p.217"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"191"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"217"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01442afa54980587\" href=\"?note=01442afa54980587\" title=\"28-df-symmetric-encryption\">28-df-symmetric-encryption</a> 的正确对称加密方案；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_j\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_j\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见所列本地定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(q_1,q_2,b,l,H)\">\\(A=(q_1,q_2,b,l,H)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_1,q_2,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(q_1,q_2,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(H\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 比特串；密钥生成、每次 oracle 应答、挑战加密、种子选择及挑战位分别使用相互独立的随机位，全部加密调用共享所抽取的密钥。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span> 为空历史，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 表示追加；历史 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in(\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(t\\in(\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的元素为一对询问/应答字符串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}\\)</span> 为下式的二层有限序列编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tag}\">\\(\\operatorname{tag}\\)</span> 编码一个标志比特与一个字符串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Enc}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{Enc}_k\\)</span> 含显式安全参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathcal K_n\">\\(k\\in\\mathcal K_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,w,z,st,r\\in\\mathbb B^*\">\\(u,v,w,z,st,r\\in\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(B\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^+=\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B^+=\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\)</span>。比特串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=w_1\\cdots w_{|w|}\">\\(w=w_1\\cdots w_{|w|}\\)</span> 采用一基坐标，数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 与对应单比特串认同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_2\\)</span> 对任意有限比特串定义。下式的有限随机递归和末尾返回值采用顺序随机赋值语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{post}\">\\(\\operatorname{post}\\)</span> 仅在标明的合法挑战域上调用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists J\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad J(\\operatorname{tup}_2(1^n,m))=\\mathbf1[m\\in\\mathcal M_n]\">\\(\\exists J\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad J(\\operatorname{tup}_2(1^n,m))=\\mathbf1[m\\in\\mathcal M_n]\\)</span>；消息合法性检验统一有效。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_2(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^{|w|}w_j2^{|w|-j},\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;[(i=0\\land w=\\langle0\\rangle)\\lor(w_1=1\\land\\operatorname{val}_2(w)=i)]\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_2(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^{|w|}w_j2^{|w|-j},\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;[(i=0\\land w=\\langle0\\rangle)\\lor(w_1=1\\land\\operatorname{val}_2(w)=i)]\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tag}(a,u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\langle a\\rangle,u\\rangle)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B,u\\in\\mathbb B^*),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(\\langle(u_j,v_j)\\rangle_{j=1}^d)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle u_j,v_j\\rangle)\\rangle_{j=1}^d)\\quad(d\\in\\mathbb N,u_j,v_j\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tag}(a,u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\langle a\\rangle,u\\rangle)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B,u\\in\\mathbb B^*),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(\\langle(u_j,v_j)\\rangle_{j=1}^d)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle u_j,v_j\\rangle)\\rangle_{j=1}^d)\\quad(d\\in\\mathbb N,u_j,v_j\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\Pi\\coloneqq\\mathbb N[n]^4\\times\\mathbf{FP},\\qquad\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u&amp;|u|\\le l(n),\\\\\\langle0\\rangle&amp;|u|&gt;l(n),\\end{cases}\\qquad\\beta(w)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_1&amp;|w|\\ge1,\\\\0&amp;w=\\epsilon.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_\\Pi\\coloneqq\\mathbb N[n]^4\\times\\mathbf{FP},\\qquad\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u&amp;|u|\\le l(n),\\\\\\langle0\\rangle&amp;|u|&gt;l(n),\\end{cases}\\qquad\\beta(w)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_1&amp;|w|\\ge1,\\\\0&amp;w=\\epsilon.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u)(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\Pr[\\operatorname{tag}(1,\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m))=v]&amp;u=\\operatorname{tag}(1,m),\\ m\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\mathbf1[v=\\langle0\\rangle]&amp;\\neg\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ u=\\operatorname{tag}(1,m).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u)(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\Pr[\\operatorname{tag}(1,\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m))=v]&amp;u=\\operatorname{tag}(1,m),\\ m\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\mathbf1[v=\\langle0\\rangle]&amp;\\neg\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ u=\\operatorname{tag}(1,m).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m_0,m_1\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ \\exists st\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle m_0,m_1,st\\rangle)\\land|m_0|=|m_1|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m_0,m_1\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ \\exists st\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle m_0,m_1,st\\rangle)\\land|m_0|=|m_1|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{post}_{\\Pi,A,n,k}(r,B,z,t)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;(m_0,m_1,st)\\leftarrow\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(z);\\quad c\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m_B);\\quad s_0\\leftarrow t;\\\\&amp;u_i&#39;\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\operatorname{tup}_7(\\operatorname{bin}(2),1^n,r,st,c,\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(s_{i-1}))));\\quad v_i&#39;\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u_i&#39;);\\quad s_i\\leftarrow s_{i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle(u_i&#39;,v_i&#39;)\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_2(n));\\\\&amp;\\mathbf1[\\beta(H(\\operatorname{tup}_6(\\operatorname{bin}(3),1^n,r,st,c,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(s_{q_2(n)}))))=B]\\end{aligned}\\right]\\quad(\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{post}_{\\Pi,A,n,k}(r,B,z,t)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;(m_0,m_1,st)\\leftarrow\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(z);\\quad c\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m_B);\\quad s_0\\leftarrow t;\\\\&amp;u_i&#39;\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\operatorname{tup}_7(\\operatorname{bin}(2),1^n,r,st,c,\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(s_{i-1}))));\\quad v_i&#39;\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u_i&#39;);\\quad s_i\\leftarrow s_{i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle(u_i&#39;,v_i&#39;)\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_2(n));\\\\&amp;\\mathbf1[\\beta(H(\\operatorname{tup}_6(\\operatorname{bin}(3),1^n,r,st,c,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(s_{q_2(n)}))))=B]\\end{aligned}\\right]\\quad(\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exp}^{\\mathrm{ind\\text{-}cpa}}_{\\Pi,A}(n)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;k\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n);\\quad B\\leftarrow U_1;\\quad r\\leftarrow U_{b(n)};\\quad t_0\\leftarrow();\\\\&amp;u_i\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\operatorname{tup}_5(\\operatorname{bin}(0),1^n,r,\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(t_{i-1}))));\\quad v_i\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u_i);\\quad t_i\\leftarrow t_{i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle(u_i,v_i)\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_1(n));\\\\&amp;z\\leftarrow H(\\operatorname{tup}_4(\\operatorname{bin}(1),1^n,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(t_{q_1(n)})));\\\\&amp;\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{post}_{\\Pi,A,n,k}(r,B,z,t_{q_1(n)})&amp;\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z),\\\\U_1&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z).\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exp}^{\\mathrm{ind\\text{-}cpa}}_{\\Pi,A}(n)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;k\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n);\\quad B\\leftarrow U_1;\\quad r\\leftarrow U_{b(n)};\\quad t_0\\leftarrow();\\\\&amp;u_i\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\operatorname{tup}_5(\\operatorname{bin}(0),1^n,r,\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(t_{i-1}))));\\quad v_i\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u_i);\\quad t_i\\leftarrow t_{i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle(u_i,v_i)\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_1(n));\\\\&amp;z\\leftarrow H(\\operatorname{tup}_4(\\operatorname{bin}(1),1^n,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(t_{q_1(n)})));\\\\&amp;\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{post}_{\\Pi,A,n,k}(r,B,z,t_{q_1(n)})&amp;\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z),\\\\U_1&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z).\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{INDCPA}(\\Pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_\\Pi\\quad\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr[\\operatorname{Exp}^{\\mathrm{ind\\text{-}cpa}}_{\\Pi,A}(n)=1]-\\tfrac12\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{INDCPA}(\\Pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_\\Pi\\quad\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr[\\operatorname{Exp}^{\\mathrm{ind\\text{-}cpa}}_{\\Pi,A}(n)=1]-\\tfrac12\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次编码修订使用线性长度的序列码表示历史，固定外层元数使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_j\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_j\\)</span>；阶段号和询问编号均先变为规范二进制串。合法挑战恰为三个消息/状态字符串的序列码，所以部分逆只在已验证的定义域内使用。</p>\n<p>使用FP函数、固定攻击者种子和有多项式长度裁剪的查询日程，显式展开挑战前后两个自适应阶段。合法查询的加密应答使用新鲜随机性；非法查询给带标签空响应，非法挑战返回独立公平成功位，故不会因非法行为产生固定1/2优势。末位猜测通过总比特解码β保证总定义。扁平历史、固定方案的密文长度界及查询裁剪保证总计算仍为多项式。等长挑战、可重复使用密钥、挑战前后 oracle 访问和所有随机性现在属于前两节。IND-CPA 精确定义是对 §9.5.1 多消息安全讨论的现代补充；本次没有在该书找到同名完整实验，故不标为逐字对应原书定义，也不从本节点推断书中已证明 CPA 安全。</p>\n<p>R7复核：β明确读取1基第一比特，空串分支给0。本条仍是§9.5.1背景上的现代补充实验，不声称原书直接给出IND-CPA定义或其安全性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-symmetric-encryption","status":"resolved","id":"01442afa54980587","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-symmetric-encryption]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-symmetric-encryption","status":"resolved","id":"01442afa54980587","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})$ 为 [[28-df-symmetric-encryption]] 的正确对称加密方案；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{FP}$、$\\operatorname{tup}_j$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$\\mathbf{PPT}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见所列本地定义。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})$ 为 [[28-df-symmetric-encryption]] 的正确对称加密方案；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{FP}$、$\\operatorname{tup}_j$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$\\mathbf{PPT}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见所列本地定义。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。$\\epsilon$ 为空串，$()$ 为空历史，$\\frown$ 表示追加；历史 $t\\in(\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*)^{<\\omega}$ 的元素为一对询问/应答字符串。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}$ 为下式的二层有限序列编码；$\\operatorname{tag}$ 编码一个标志比特与一个字符串；$\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码自然数。$\\operatorname{Enc}_k$ 含显式安全参数 $1^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"A=(q_1,q_2,b,l,H)","display":false},{"tex":"q_1,q_2,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in(\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tag}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Enc}_k","display":false},{"tex":"1^n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathcal K_n","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,w,z,st,r\\in\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^+=\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"w=w_1\\cdots w_{|w|}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{post}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists J\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad J(\\operatorname{tup}_2(1^n,m))=\\mathbf1[m\\in\\mathcal M_n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_2(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^{|w|}w_j2^{|w|-j},\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;[(i=0\\land w=\\langle0\\rangle)\\lor(w_1=1\\land\\operatorname{val}_2(w)=i)]\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tag}(a,u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\langle a\\rangle,u\\rangle)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B,u\\in\\mathbb B^*),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(\\langle(u_j,v_j)\\rangle_{j=1}^d)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle u_j,v_j\\rangle)\\rangle_{j=1}^d)\\quad(d\\in\\mathbb N,u_j,v_j\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\Pi\\coloneqq\\mathbb N[n]^4\\times\\mathbf{FP},\\qquad\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u&|u|\\le l(n),\\\\\\langle0\\rangle&|u|>l(n),\\end{cases}\\qquad\\beta(w)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_1&|w|\\ge1,\\\\0&w=\\epsilon.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u)(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\Pr[\\operatorname{tag}(1,\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m))=v]&u=\\operatorname{tag}(1,m),\\ m\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\mathbf1[v=\\langle0\\rangle]&\\neg\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ u=\\operatorname{tag}(1,m).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m_0,m_1\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ \\exists st\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle m_0,m_1,st\\rangle)\\land|m_0|=|m_1|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{post}_{\\Pi,A,n,k}(r,B,z,t)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&(m_0,m_1,st)\\leftarrow\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(z);\\quad c\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m_B);\\quad s_0\\leftarrow t;\\\\&u_i'\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\operatorname{tup}_7(\\operatorname{bin}(2),1^n,r,st,c,\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(s_{i-1}))));\\quad v_i'\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u_i');\\quad s_i\\leftarrow s_{i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle(u_i',v_i')\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_2(n));\\\\&\\mathbf1[\\beta(H(\\operatorname{tup}_6(\\operatorname{bin}(3),1^n,r,st,c,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(s_{q_2(n)}))))=B]\\end{aligned}\\right]\\quad(\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exp}^{\\mathrm{ind\\text{-}cpa}}_{\\Pi,A}(n)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&k\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n);\\quad B\\leftarrow U_1;\\quad r\\leftarrow U_{b(n)};\\quad t_0\\leftarrow();\\\\&u_i\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\operatorname{tup}_5(\\operatorname{bin}(0),1^n,r,\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(t_{i-1}))));\\quad v_i\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Pi,n,k}(u_i);\\quad t_i\\leftarrow t_{i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle(u_i,v_i)\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_1(n));\\\\&z\\leftarrow H(\\operatorname{tup}_4(\\operatorname{bin}(1),1^n,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}(t_{q_1(n)})));\\\\&\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{post}_{\\Pi,A,n,k}(r,B,z,t_{q_1(n)})&\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z),\\\\U_1&\\neg\\operatorname{Valid}_{\\Pi,n}(z).\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{INDCPA}(\\Pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_\\Pi\\quad\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr[\\operatorname{Exp}^{\\mathrm{ind\\text{-}cpa}}_{\\Pi,A}(n)=1]-\\tfrac12\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_j","display":false}],"bytes":6614,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"密码方案：[[28-df-symmetric-encryption]]、[[28-df-ind-cpa]]、[[28-df-trapdoor-permutation]]、[[28-df-digital-signature]]。"}],"outgoing":["3e270c20bc5033b3","01442afa54980587","f3171800627deef3","adb92775ec020a0b","b75200f005282ddf"]}